# Split ownership (SPLIT.md)

- Do not restyle `mobile/src/components/**`, `mobile/src/theme.js`, or App.js layout/styles from the backend branch.
- Backend may add one tab or modal line in `App.js` and a plain probe under `mobile/src/game/`.
- Presentation reads `state.pets`, `egg`, `hatching`, `turf`, `xpBoost`, and `leaderboard`.
